00:03:42,720 --> 00:03:46,000
But trust me that most people working on this duality

52
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:51,120
miles away from geometric Langlands. It's a much, much more general duality than geometric Langlands.

53
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:57,380
We have to specialize it a lot to get anywhere close to geometric Langlands. To do so, we first

54
00:03:57,380 --> 00:04:02,500
consider what's called a topological twist that leads to a family of topological field theories

55
00:04:02,500 --> 00:04:10,740
parameterized by complex parameters psi or psi dual. And if we study the whole family, then

