00:45:01,690 --> 00:45:05,800
if you impose a certain natural condition.

829
00:45:05,800 --> 00:45:09,280
In general, if B1 and B2 are any branes,

830
00:45:09,280 --> 00:45:12,620
there is a non-degenerate bilinear, not Hermitian gearing,

831
00:45:12,620 --> 00:45:17,240
from HOM B1, B2 to HOM B2, B1.

832
00:45:17,240 --> 00:45:19,280
To get a Hermitian inner product,

