00:45:19,280 --> 00:45:23,560
non-degenerate commission inner product in HOM B1 B2 is therefore the same as finding

834
00:45:23,560 --> 00:45:30,320
an anti-linear map from HOM B2 B1 to HOM B1 B2. And Gukov and I showed that there is

835
00:45:30,320 --> 00:45:36,560
such an anti-linear map if there's an anti-holomorphic map teller from Y to itself with M as a component

836
00:45:36,560 --> 00:45:47,750
of its fixed point set. So that's the condition that leads to having a Hermitian inner product.

837
00:45:47,750 --> 00:45:51,830
I won't explain how we define theta tell, but I will explain why you should expect

